  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Internal: a use of a transaction's connection from inside another use of it fails at once, with an exception that says so,** where it ran on the connection together with the use it was inside, a collision no provider supports. No Compze code does it: a probe found none in the full suite on all five persistence layers. And a transaction that completes during a use of its connection, as one that holds a durable resource already does as it refuses Compze's SQLite connection, has the connection disposed as that use ends, not under it.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.13.0-internal (was 0.12.1-internal). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
